Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:10.47,Signs - General,,0,0,0,,Humarise美國分支機構
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:19.12,Signs - General,,0,0,0,,Humarise新加坡分支機構
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:27.84,Signs - General,,0,0,0,,世界精英英雄團隊 總司令部
