Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.35,0:59:46.35,Signs - General,,0,0,0,,鄰國克萊德
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.77,1:03:19.40,Signs - General,,0,0,0,Down,克萊德機場
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.39,1:38:43.39,Signs - General,,0,0,0,Down,回國日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在過去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,曾讓人無法想像的異能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:41.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也就是所謂的“個性”為什麼會被賦予給了人類
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.55,0:00:47.07,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,第一個異能者全身發光的嬰兒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:47.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼會誕生於這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:50.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這都是一場悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:56.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“個性”不是人類的福音 而是終焉的開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:01:02.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,正如這本《個性末日論》中所寫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:06.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,隨著世代的變遷“個性”開始混合和進化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:10.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,直到最終 再沒有人可以控制他們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:16.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,當下這個時代80%的人類都身患“個性”這個疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:20.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,剩下的20%的純粹人類
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:24.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,仍和“個性”持有者保持來往 減少其人數
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:27.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,滅絕就在我們眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:31.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們 Humarise……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.10,0:01:35.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現在必須採取行動！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:38.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,即使這將讓大地染成鮮血
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:42.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都是為了人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:45.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:58.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:00.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現在 讓我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:29.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:32.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有“個性”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:38.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你已經獲救了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:50.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,歐爾麥特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:57.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,諸位英雄 這個任務成敗與否 就落在你們的肩上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:01.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,讓我們奪回那些在活在恐懼中的人們的笑容吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.60,0:05:26.85,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,A隊 我們一定要在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:26.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“Trigger炸彈”啟動前完成回收！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:27.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:28.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就是那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Humarise的奧森總部……
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.55,0:05:36.47,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,我們B隊的任務是取得設施的控制權
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:36.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,並抓捕他們的領袖弗雷克特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:37.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要放鬆警惕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:40.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你以為你在和誰說話？ 哼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--停下！--未經許可不得進入！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要是反抗別怪我不手下留情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:54.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,克蕾爾 找出“Trigger炸彈”！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:55.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:57.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,伯恩絲！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,竟然在這裡使用個性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆豪 他們的大多數成員都沒有個性的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:09.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要太粗暴--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:10.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,眩暈手榴彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,安德瓦 有古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哪裡都找不到裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:36.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:38.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,B隊 找到弗雷克特了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,馬上就要接觸目標
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.82,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,抓住他之後 從他嘴裡撬出
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“Trigger 炸彈”的位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.97,0:06:43.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,了解！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:46.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,弗雷克特·丹恩 就在那個房間裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:53.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,領袖逃掉了！檢查下四周！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的 我們審問了落網的人員
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:16.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有一個人知道“Trigger炸彈”的窩藏地點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:17.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,應該說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:19.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連這個炸彈本身的存在都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:22.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,貌似其他分支機構的成員也一樣情況
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,剛才的恐怖攻擊事件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是Humarise的首領弗雷克特·丹恩的直屬部下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,實施恐怖攻擊的可能性很大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:32.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,長官
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可能有我們不知道的其他設施
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們預測到我們的行動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,提前運走了“Trigger炸彈”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:43.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所有英雄小隊各自在當地待命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,發出英雄增援的請求
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,搜尋出Humarise的秘密基地！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我必須把這個交給……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣子下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,世界將被毀滅！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:43.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,羅羅 拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:45.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哥哥快要出門上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:46.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你們要好好在家--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--學~習~！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果哥哥很晚才能回家--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--那就做~飯~！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:10:00.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果有奇怪的人來敲門--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--絕對無視他們~！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,說得好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--好！--好！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不過我想今天應該不會太晚回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:10.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,皮諾！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:17.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好的 那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一路順風！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:43.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,大叔 有工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:53.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在東三號街收取包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:56.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拿到之後送到南格羅夫的中餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,事成之後有多少錢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:02.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你以為你可以討價還價嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:04.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,少問東問西 不做就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:09.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好的 好的 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:17.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,喂 那是我的腳踏車
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:18.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,反正是偷來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,用完我再還給它的主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:24.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,少自以為是 臭小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好了 工作工作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:41.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡好繁華
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,畢竟這裡是奧森最大的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:48.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我才不管在這待命什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:51.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼本大爺非得出來跑腿！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,誰讓我們是隊伍裡的吊車尾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:54.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:57.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們這次能夠加入世界精英英雄團隊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是因為恰巧在安德瓦事務所實習
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,換句話說 我們是隊伍的附贈品
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:06.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但既然我們是團隊的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就要全力以赴 保護每個人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,意識形態組織 Humarise…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:14.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,痴迷於該死的妄想的該死組織……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:17.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼“個性末日論”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:21.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這麼毫無依據的故事竟然還信以為真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.15,0:12:26.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們是珠寶竊賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:28.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快抓住他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:30.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,該死 是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,老地方見！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:32.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,手提箱就拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:35.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你們追右邊的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:36.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:38.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,滾開！滾開！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:40.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都說了快滾開！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:42.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,黑鞭！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,轟君 犯人交給你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:45.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,活該！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:58.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這爆炸真軟綿綿！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:02.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,給你見識下真正的爆炸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:13.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還真慢…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不會是假情報吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:21.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:30.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 沒有用！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:33.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,解決得比預期還久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:37.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,轟君！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:39.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷 這邊沒發現手提箱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,扔在什麼地方了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們還有同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:04.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真是遺憾！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:27.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這麼快就跑到那去了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:33.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真纏人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:39.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,黑鞭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:48.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你好呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:06.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:09.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,應該還沒跑遠！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:12.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要追上本大爺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:15.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還早了一百萬年！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:51.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:52.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:56.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,事故！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:56.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那邊讓我來處理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:15:59.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:04.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒…沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:09.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要來不及了……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:15.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:22.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:29.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真要命的一天……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:34.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啊 我最好的衣服都弄髒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:37.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,說起來…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:39.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這都是那個英雄的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.57,0:16:43.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡以前有他這樣的英雄嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:47.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,算了 反正再也見不到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:01.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼要追我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼要逃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:05.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我工作很忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:06.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,商務約談
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.57,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,別看我這副打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,其實我的職業是一個專業推銷員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:14.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,能拜託你別妨礙我工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:18.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,能讓我看下手提箱裡面裝著什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:21.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你要付我多少錢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--嗯？--手提箱裡的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:26.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不付錢當然不可能讓你白看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:29.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我只是想確認下裡面的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:29.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我說你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不是隸屬我們國家的英雄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:37.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,未經許可在其他國家展開英雄活動真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:39.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這個……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連權限都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,能不能別對我發號施令呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:44.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還是說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我應該告訴警察
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:49.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我被人無理追捕、審訊逼供呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:51.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要不要這麼做呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果你能理解最好啦
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.02,0:18:00.72,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,那麼想要展開英雄活動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:18:00.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,應該待在自己的國家做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:01.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:02.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:09.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我只是想看看手提箱裡面的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果想看 那就付我錢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:13.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我會付的 給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,十萬歐元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:18.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也太貴了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:20.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那就給我放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:20.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就看一眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:24.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,給我適可而止！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:35.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.95,0:18:39.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,寶石呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.75,0:18:45.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,辛苦您了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嘿 過來這邊一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:50.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,看看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這些孔是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:54.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.97,0:19:12.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:13.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:16.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這邊會採取措施的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:18.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,繼續跟蹤手提箱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:20.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別忘了 貝洛絲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:26.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,被"個性"病魔附身的人唯一的救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:30.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就是去拯救無辜的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:32.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:37.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真~的~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好有氣勢……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:43.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這就是所謂的“日本土下座”嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,能解開誤會真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:48.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,再說了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:52.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄肯定偶爾也會犯錯的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:54.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,喂喂 怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:56.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,手提箱裡面的東西不對呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,裡面不應該是寶石嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:00.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:01.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:06.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拿錯箱子了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我還有點事 那就先這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你流了好多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:15.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:32.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你真的還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.47,0:20:36.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:37.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:38.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,把手舉起來 坐在原地！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.89,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,請等一下！他--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:59.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--我沒有偷任何東西！--停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:01.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們取得開火權限了！開火！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:06.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,臉朝前方 咬緊牙關！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.75,0:21:47.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼他們會突然開火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還以為……我要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:06.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已經追上來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:28.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在這裡其他人會被捲進來！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.17,0:22:29.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要追上來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:45.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不好--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:12.67,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,你們這些白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:16.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們現在正執行重要任務！
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.55,0:23:19.92,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,除此以外的案件
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.55,0:23:19.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,交給當地的事務所英雄來辦就夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.07,0:23:22.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,去幫助陷入麻煩的人 正是英雄所為
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:24.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在實習期間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:27.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我還沒來得及搞懂分配工作的重要性
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:28.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還毫無反省之心！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.37,0:23:30.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:34.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他去追擊寶石竊賊的同夥了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:37.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,到現在都還沒有來電
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:38.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,太散漫了！
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.72,0:23:41.75,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,就算是來事務所實習
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.72,0:23:41.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也果然不應該帶你們來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:43.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷打過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:46.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷 疑犯和手提箱怎樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:50.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:51.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.97,0:23:54.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還沒搞清楚什麼狀況 突然就朝我們開槍了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:56.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,匆忙逃跑之後
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:58.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,又被一個貌似是敵人聯軍的傢伙襲擊了--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:03.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:07.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我追上那個拿著手提箱逃跑的人 抓住了他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:12.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,安德瓦 出事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:13.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久他…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.30,0:24:15.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…的線索
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:19.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,再次重複 根據警方的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.27,0:24:22.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“擊殺12人”案件的犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:27.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是日本英雄“笨久” 真名叫做綠谷出久
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.35,0:24:29.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現已被列入全國通緝令
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:34.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--據目擊者稱他還有同伴--喂？你好？轟君
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.25,0:24:37.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷……你到底做了什麼
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.65,0:24:43.37,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,你現在已經成了“通緝令”裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.65,0:24:43.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,大量殺人案的兇手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.07,0:24:47.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,通…通緝令是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:24:59.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:01.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你聯繫上你的同伴了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:05.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼把電池拆出來
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.55,0:25:07.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們說什麼時候來接我們
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.87,0:25:09.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,關於這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是奧森小隊的緊急來電！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:16.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久成了通緝犯！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.25,0:25:19.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷少年他！？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:21.60,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,怎麼會發生這種事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.92,0:25:24.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,情報顯示他在奧森當地殺死了12名平民……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.30,0:25:27.17,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,這太荒謬了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:29.97,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,但這是來自司令部的情報…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.05,0:25:31.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等下等下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:34.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷不可能會做出這種事！對吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.57,0:25:37.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,當然了 這一定是有誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:38.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就是說呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:41.20,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,我不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:42.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久君他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.92,0:25:46.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久君絕不會做這種事！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:47.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哇吹
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:49.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這背後一定有隱情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.82,0:25:50.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:54.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別擔心 安德瓦他們肯定在調查緣由
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,究竟是怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.95,0:26:04.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你是兇手 我是共犯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.97,0:26:06.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們什麼時候成同伴了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.70,0:26:08.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,給我解釋清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:10.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.10,0:26:13.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…怎麼會變成現在這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.25,0:26:17.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啊 完了……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:20.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還以為我的人生已經跌到谷底了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.00,0:26:23.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,竟然還能往下跌
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:24.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,太倒霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.75,0:26:28.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這全都是你的錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.02,0:26:31.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快做點什麼！你不是英雄嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.82,0:26:35.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,警察二話不說就朝我們開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:37.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還被敵人聯軍的人襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.52,0:26:39.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可以看出
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:41.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們不在乎我們的死活
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:45.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,換句話說 他們的目標不是我們
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:47.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是這個手提箱嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:50.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.37,0:26:53.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,找不到任何可疑的東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.05,0:26:55.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等等 你在做什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.90,0:26:58.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們想要的是這個手提箱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.97,0:26:59.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:00.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果把手提箱給了他們
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.80,0:27:02.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那一切都解決了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.35,0:27:04.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒錯！就是這麼簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:07.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒那麼簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:10.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們可能會以為我們知道了手提箱的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.45,0:27:12.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,殺我們滅口
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.00,0:27:14.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.82,0:27:17.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要想得那麼消極
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.47,0:27:19.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,對了！燒了這個手提箱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:20.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們可以說
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.10,0:27:21.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“手提箱不小心著火燒掉了！”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.00,0:27:23.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣下場還是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.82,0:27:27.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那乾脆報警吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:28.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,誒？為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.27,0:27:30.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“如果你想要這個手提箱--”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.70,0:27:32.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“--那就拿一百萬歐元來贖走！”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.97,0:27:34.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那樣就真成了名副其實的犯罪了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:37.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不能這麼輕率行動！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.65,0:27:39.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,吶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.60,0:27:41.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,果然還是把手提箱交出去吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.15,0:27:44.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,會有什麼生命危險
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:45.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.92,0:27:51.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果這個手提箱和某個犯罪案件有關
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.57,0:27:53.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,決不能輕易把它交給別人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.27,0:27:55.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要因為你的正義感
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.57,0:27:57.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也把我捲進麻煩裡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:27:58.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們早就已經
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.90,0:28:00.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,被捲進麻煩裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.45,0:28:03.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們瞄準的是我們的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.52,0:28:05.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果沒搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.72,0:28:07.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這個手提箱的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.50,0:28:09.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就輕率行事 只會凶多吉少
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.50,0:28:12.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:13.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現在該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.35,0:28:17.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:38.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在他們發現之前儘快出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.30,0:28:40.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,敵人聯軍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.75,0:28:42.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,萬一敵人聯軍來追我們怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.67,0:28:44.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果敵人聯軍來了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.80,0:28:46.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我一定會盡力確保你安全
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.70,0:28:50.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--嗯？--目前逃跑是第一事項
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.35,0:28:53.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啊 是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.65,0:28:55.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我知道啦 走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.67,0:28:57.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,邊境也好仙境也好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.05,0:28:58.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都走給你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:00.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那邊的公車
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:02.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是開往邊境方向的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.72,0:29:03.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們可以躲在車後方
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.00,0:29:04.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,坐霸王車
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.62,0:29:05.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好好付車費
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:07.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,才可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.05,0:29:08.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們正在被通緝
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.82,0:29:10.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,萬一被人發現舉報就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.27,0:29:15.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啊 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.62,0:29:19.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,上來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.05,0:29:20.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,尊貴的(乘)蹭客
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:22.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣我們都是一路貨色了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:23.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄大人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.80,0:29:33.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,投幣了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:34.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,投了兩人份
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:37.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那不經同意跳上車頂就可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.00,0:29:39.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好像也不行……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.02,0:29:44.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,局長！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.05,0:29:47.05,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,麻煩您提供下證據
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.25,0:29:50.70,Subtitles,,0,0,5,,懷疑綠谷出久是大量殺人犯的證據！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.07,0:29:53.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,關於綠谷出久的案件還在調查中
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.05,0:29:56.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,目前不能公開搜索情報
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,更何況 你和他同樣都是日本英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.10,0:30:00.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那就更不能說了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.37,0:30:13.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,第 5 階段的重症患者
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.42,0:30:18.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.67,0:30:21.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,焦凍君！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:24.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我從一個偵探朋友那裡拿到了調查報告
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.77,0:30:25.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,結果怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.47,0:30:29.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你所見到的被“個性”破壞的那輛車
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.82,0:30:31.16,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,聽說駕駛人員
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:33.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是 Humarise 的成員
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.52,0:30:35.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Humarise！？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.42,0:30:37.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那傢伙現在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.95,0:30:39.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他陷入了昏迷狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.77,0:30:41.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,目前在醫院ICU休養
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.22,0:30:43.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,有警察在看管
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:46.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒辦法和他談話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.72,0:30:48.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,另外還有一件案子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.20,0:30:50.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在案發現場發現
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.50,0:30:53.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,被盜的珠寶撒落現場一地
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.40,0:30:55.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.40,0:30:58.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是綠谷發來的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.25,0:31:00.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他說什麼
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.85,0:31:03.72,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,天黑了的話 別客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.85,0:31:03.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,原來冰箱裡還有草莓 吃得開心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:06.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他讓我們吃草莓……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.27,0:31:08.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這不是加密信息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:10.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:13.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,客…來…得…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.80,0:31:15.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,克萊德
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.55,0:31:18.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他是指鄰國克萊德吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.45,0:31:21.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷正趕往那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.60,0:31:23.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我要出發去克萊德
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.95,0:31:24.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.85,0:31:26.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,之後我會報告給安德瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.70,0:31:28.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆豪 我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.67,0:31:29.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,突然間幹嘛——
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.65,0:31:34.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,有來自笨久的消息 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:36.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的 稍後再告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.22,0:31:40.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,首先要甩掉那些守衛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.00,0:31:42.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要命令我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.07,0:31:49.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,希望轟君他們能解出
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:53.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這個手提箱隱藏的秘密……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.70,0:32:02.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.80,0:32:04.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有警察……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.35,0:32:06.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我說
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.90,0:32:08.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,打個電話應該可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:09.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.32,0:32:12.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,新聞報導裡沒有提及到關於你的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.20,0:32:13.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你應該是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.05,0:32:15.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不過儘量速戰速決
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.80,0:32:16.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.65,0:32:24.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哦——大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:28.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,呃 很抱歉突然來電
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.42,0:32:30.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可以麻煩你去我家一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.30,0:32:31.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,告訴我的弟弟和妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.65,0:32:33.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我短時間內不會回家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,後面會付錢給你的--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:40.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這又不是我的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:41.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.85,0:32:44.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我收到了客人的投訴 說沒有收到貨
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.52,0:32:45.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,呃 那是因為——
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.80,0:32:47.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不是你想的這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:57.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,老子又沒有拿到貨…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.20,0:33:00.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.07,0:33:03.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,發生了什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:07.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:09.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.30,0:33:12.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,手提箱掉包了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:16.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯 從敵人聯軍那奪走的裝著寶石的手提箱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.80,0:33:19.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好像在綠谷追逐途中和另一個手提箱搞混了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.42,0:33:23.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現在綠谷手中的箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.42,0:33:24.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是屬於 Humarise 成員的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:28.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,警察對笨久窮追不捨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.50,0:33:29.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就是這個原因嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.77,0:33:30.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,應該是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.47,0:33:32.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那個手提箱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.40,0:33:33.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,應該非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.10,0:33:35.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果不是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.90,0:33:37.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,警察也不會大舉出手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:41.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,看來警察中有人是 Humarise 成員
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.15,0:33:42.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:45.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不知道 Humarise 的耳目會出現在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.37,0:33:47.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們必須謹慎行事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.72,0:33:48.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要命令我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:56.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,跟預料的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.90,0:33:59.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有交通工具在邊境有站下車
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.65,0:34:01.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要嘛在這附近找一輛車
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.15,0:34:03.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,或者用腳走過去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.47,0:34:06.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,走路！？不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.62,0:34:08.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你知道離這有多遠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.90,0:34:11.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,走累了 我可以背你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.30,0:34:13.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.65,0:34:16.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就是用來幫助有困難的人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.42,0:34:21.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我現在已經惹一身麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.42,0:34:22.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你能不能快點幫我解決
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:25.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯 我一定會幫你解決的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.07,0:34:43.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,看好 要起飛囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.97,0:34:49.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哥哥 我也要玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.22,0:34:54.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:55.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,下一個到我！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.67,0:34:56.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.27,0:34:59.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真有力氣呢 洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.00,0:35:03.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爸爸 歡迎回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.65,0:35:05.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.37,0:35:24.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,吶 這次的拼圖好難！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.37,0:35:26.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎樣才能解得開
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.67,0:35:28.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那爸爸稍微給點提示
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.92,0:35:42.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,後面應該會解開了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.22,0:35:51.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爸爸 這是你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.12,0:35:53.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,送你的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.52,0:35:58.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,謝謝你一直在照顧羅羅和拉拉 洛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.40,0:36:07.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,聽說那一家人的父親失蹤了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.22,0:36:08.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.10,0:36:10.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,聽說還加入了 Humarise
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.87,0:36:13.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那個瘋狂組織
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:15.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還主張“個性”是一種疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.00,0:36:18.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,前幾天也發生了這樣類似的失蹤事件
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.55,0:36:20.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還是有名的工程師呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:22.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真是人不可貌相
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.87,0:36:26.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,孩子們 以後不許再和他們一起玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.60,0:36:28.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都不知道他們會對你們做些什麼奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.67,0:36:29.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.80,0:36:31.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--我們走吧！--好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.65,0:36:40.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.92,0:36:43.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哥哥會一直在你們身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.45,0:36:46.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無論發生任何事情
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.52,0:37:31.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.17,0:37:40.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.32,0:37:48.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.00,0:38:03.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是警方的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.90,0:38:05.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,交出手提箱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.97,0:38:11.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這一來
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.97,0:38:14.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就和我無關了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.62,0:38:18.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你的同伴在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.77,0:38:20.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.50,0:38:22.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你們都知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.27,0:38:27.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這個手提箱的秘密！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.27,0:38:30.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不…不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.17,0:38:33.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼都不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.55,0:38:37.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,弟弟和妹妹還在等我回家！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.17,0:38:39.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.75,0:38:41.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,放我回家吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.82,0:38:47.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,空中武力沒用…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.30,0:38:49.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那就…！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.92,0:38:52.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆碎風！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.17,0:39:00.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我……！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.35,0:39:11.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆碎風！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.52,0:39:16.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.15,0:39:18.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,趕快抓緊我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.87,0:39:23.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.40,0:39:35.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等一下 我馬上去找點藥回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:37.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,傷口沒有那麼嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.82,0:39:40.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不過手機壞掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.22,0:39:44.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.82,0:39:46.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可以幫我從背包裡拿出急救箱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.55,0:39:48.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好…好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.67,0:39:51.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那個敵人太棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:54.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,包紮好後 我們馬上離開這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.77,0:40:11.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼要保護我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.50,0:40:13.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你說為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:20.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是我拿走了手提箱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.22,0:40:22.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我背叛了你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.82,0:40:25.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,比起保護我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.42,0:40:27.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,把手提箱搶回來趁機逃掉不是更好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我做不到那種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.85,0:40:32.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,今天下午也是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.65,0:40:35.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還想偷運敵人聯軍搶出來的寶石
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:38.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我可是英雄眼中最厭惡的現行犯呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.82,0:40:41.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我做不到對有麻煩的人置之不理
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.57,0:40:45.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無論怎樣都想幫助他們
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.97,0:40:49.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,因此受傷也太不划算了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.70,0:40:52.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果能夠幫到別人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.90,0:40:54.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那我就心滿意足了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.35,0:40:59.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真搞不懂你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.72,0:41:04.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我一直仰慕著…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.40,0:41:08.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,成為一個
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.30,0:41:11.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,帶著微笑去拯救眾人的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.62,0:41:15.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我想像歐爾麥特一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.30,0:41:17.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,歐爾麥特？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.35,0:41:19.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你是說那個世界聞名的歐爾麥特
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.25,0:41:21.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯 他是我的老師
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.95,0:41:23.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.07,0:41:28.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你想成為歐爾麥特一樣的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:31.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以你追逐那個夢想 成為了英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.70,0:41:35.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,和我完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.67,0:41:36.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.62,0:41:38.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我想像不出自己的未來會是怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.70,0:41:41.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼“想成為一名飛行員”…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.87,0:41:43.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,根本沒有空閒說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.05,0:41:46.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,光是照顧年幼的兄弟姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.05,0:41:47.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.10,0:41:49.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--我也…  --什麼都別說！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.57,0:41:51.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我不需要你的同情
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:41:59.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我以前覺得 所謂英雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:00.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,享受著眾人的注目
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.90,0:42:02.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,藉著幫助別人的名義
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.00,0:42:05.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,從富人手裡賺取金錢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.30,0:42:07.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,事實上
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.27,0:42:10.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我居住的小鎮上沒有一個英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.55,0:42:12.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在那裡賺不到錢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.70,0:42:20.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但我猜應該也有像你這樣的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.00,0:42:23.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你越是幫助我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.80,0:42:26.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我就越忍不住會回想自己過去究竟在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.55,0:42:29.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我真的…好遜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.10,0:42:32.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我其實也很遜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.20,0:42:37.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,雖然從小我就想當英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.92,0:42:39.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是人們不斷告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.52,0:42:42.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你做不到 你成為不了英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.37,0:42:45.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,運用不好自己的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.34,0:42:46.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在班級中吊車尾
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.60,0:42:48.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那樣的我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.60,0:42:51.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,總是得到同學們的關心幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.40,0:42:54.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我還是不成火候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.07,0:42:56.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以我才想變得能夠獨當一面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.15,0:43:04.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,想成為一個帶者微笑拯救眾人的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.35,0:43:17.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,牠叫皮諾
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.35,0:43:19.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,皮諾？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.72,0:43:24.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我叫做洛迪 洛迪·索爾
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.92,0:43:26.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你叫什麼名字
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.20,0:43:30.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我叫綠谷出久
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.40,0:43:32.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄名是“笨久”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.45,0:43:35.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久？名字真好記
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.82,0:43:37.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯！我也很喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.35,0:43:41.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,稍微休息下吧 洛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.30,0:43:43.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好 說的也是 笨久
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.20,0:44:00.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可以調動軍隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.94,0:44:06.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,繼續搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.42,0:44:26.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,敵人聯軍嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.05,0:44:32.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.67,0:44:35.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,吵醒你了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.40,0:44:36.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這輛車從哪弄來的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.72,0:44:37.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我借來的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.72,0:44:39.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,走路太辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.40,0:44:42.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我留了一張紙條說 過後會付款的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.40,0:44:44.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,以英雄協會的名義
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.02,0:44:49.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果可以弄來一架塞斯納(飛機)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.32,0:44:51.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那直接就可以飛去克萊德
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:53.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你說塞斯納……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.95,0:44:55.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪 你會開飛機嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.02,0:44:57.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.60,0:44:58.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,上來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.32,0:45:03.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.42,0:45:03.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.55,0:45:05.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,只要弄清楚手提箱的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.15,0:45:07.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我就可以回家了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.12,0:45:09.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.45,0:45:13.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你有一個年幼的弟弟 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.82,0:45:14.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還有一個妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.25,0:45:16.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,父母呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.75,0:45:20.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我母親在生下最年幼的妹妹後就去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.10,0:45:24.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以我父親為了養大我們竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.97,0:45:25.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:27.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他突然就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.82,0:45:29.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:31.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你知道 Humarise 嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.80,0:45:34.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,實施無差別恐怖襲擊的恐怖組織
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.15,0:45:35.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.10,0:45:38.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別人發現父親是 Humarise 成員之後
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.60,0:45:40.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們的生活更難過了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.77,0:45:42.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,昔日的朋友遠離我們
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.87,0:45:44.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還被趕出學校和自己的家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.85,0:45:47.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,甚至找不到一份普通的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.75,0:45:48.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.22,0:45:53.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我怨恨我的父親
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.40,0:45:54.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怨恨的時間長了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.80,0:45:57.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,後來我就不再關心他死活了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.97,0:46:00.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,弟弟和妹妹現在更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.95,0:46:03.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我想讓他們過上體面的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.02,0:46:07.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真可愛的弟弟妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.95,0:46:10.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,弟弟的腦袋很聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.55,0:46:12.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,妹妹則格外的可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.42,0:46:13.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.02,0:46:16.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,長大了一定會美若天仙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.37,0:46:16.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,前面！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.57,0:46:19.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,看路呀 洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.55,0:48:57.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久的“個性”太便利了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.72,0:48:59.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,吶 洛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.57,0:49:00.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.45,0:49:01.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你也有“個性”吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.75,0:49:02.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是怎麼樣的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.95,0:49:04.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我不想說
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.00,0:49:06.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.05,0:49:10.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你不會笑我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.47,0:49:11.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不會笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.95,0:49:12.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.77,0:49:14.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對不會笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.22,0:49:17.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我的“個性”是…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.97,0:49:33.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,戒備看起來很森嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.45,0:49:36.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,看來沒有不戰而入的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.97,0:49:42.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,只能從這上面翻進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.97,0:49:47.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,上來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.80,0:49:48.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.60,0:49:48.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.30,0:49:50.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拿著這個走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.07,0:49:51.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.05,0:49:52.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都受傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.95,0:49:54.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,背著我只會更加辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.27,0:49:56.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我就到此為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.85,0:49:57.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.55,0:49:58.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,汽車已經沒油了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.20,0:50:01.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不能在這種地方丟下你一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.04,0:50:03.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你也知道我的逃跑有多快
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.82,0:50:04.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我會一邊找點漿果裹腹
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.05,0:50:06.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一邊在這裡等你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.75,0:50:08.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快去解開手提箱的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.55,0:50:09.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,然後回來接我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.27,0:50:10.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.57,0:50:12.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,全指望你了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.32,0:50:13.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.97,0:50:22.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,又是他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.15,0:50:32.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,接二連三的失手到此為止
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.62,0:50:38.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拿去用！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.15,0:50:48.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,該死！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.95,0:50:50.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那些傢伙是怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.40,0:51:11.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,德拉瓦爆碎風…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.02,0:51:14.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…空中武力！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.27,0:51:25.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.27,0:51:26.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.97,0:51:28.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯 我還好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.37,0:51:30.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,手提箱呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.22,0:51:33.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.55,0:51:42.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.97,0:51:54.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,接住 出久！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.80,0:51:55.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.70,0:52:04.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.02,0:52:15.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.52,0:52:16.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,轟君！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.30,0:52:18.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,和保須事件那時一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.55,0:52:20.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你的短信真是讓人想破頭皮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.00,0:52:26.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你在看哪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.02,0:52:32.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,放…放過我！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.82,0:52:34.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼我都願意做！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.14,0:52:36.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那麼回答我想知道的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.82,0:52:37.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.70,0:52:45.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你個叛徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.25,0:52:46.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,該死的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.07,0:52:47.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆豪 抓住她！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.65,0:52:49.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要命令我！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.52,0:53:03.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,直升機要失控了！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.87,0:53:05.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,乖乖就擒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.47,0:53:11.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.25,0:53:20.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,馬上過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.25,0:53:25.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.85,0:53:27.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.22,0:53:29.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,手提箱呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.02,0:53:31.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷 是這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.65,0:53:34.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,謝謝 轟君
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.55,0:53:35.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是你是怎麼找到我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.25,0:53:37.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,多虧在坐來的火車上
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.05,0:53:39.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,聽到這有巨大的聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.90,0:53:42.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他就是你在電話裡提到的那個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.97,0:53:43.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.97,0:53:46.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他和我一樣被當作犯罪份子對待
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.22,0:53:47.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他叫洛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.30,0:53:49.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,剛剛多虧有你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.05,0:53:51.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,先不說這些
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.45,0:53:52.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,手提箱！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.62,0:53:54.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是 Humarise 的東西 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.52,0:53:56.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是來自 Humarise 的？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.95,0:53:59.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的 所以我們才會過來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.87,0:54:02.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們覺得從箱子裡可以獲取到一些重要信息
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.35,0:54:08.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.32,0:54:10.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.50,0:54:19.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯……這是什麼玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.90,0:54:21.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要怎麼破解
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.35,0:54:23.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不是要這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.25,0:54:26.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣弄就復原了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.47,0:54:27.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真難解開
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.82,0:54:30.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這樣也不對
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.20,0:54:30.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,把那個給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.90,0:54:33.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就這玩意 看我炸開它！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.65,0:54:35.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不可以那樣做 小勝！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.77,0:54:36.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,出久
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.47,0:54:37.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,讓我看一下好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.82,0:54:39.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你知道怎麼解開嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.45,0:54:42.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我小時候有做過類似這樣的拼圖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.10,0:54:48.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,然後這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.05,0:54:49.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.00,0:54:50.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.32,0:54:56.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.02,0:54:58.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,記憶卡裡可能有關鍵信息
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.55,0:55:01.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好的 我記得山腳下有個小鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.32,0:55:03.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們在那研究一下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.35,0:55:15.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,目標已經進入鄰國克萊德
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.22,0:55:19.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,超出我的權限範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.72,0:55:20.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.87,0:55:23.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果他現在在克萊德
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.37,0:55:24.83,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在計劃執行期間
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.83,0:55:26.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他不可能趕得到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.92,0:55:33.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將計劃付諸行動的時刻到來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.17,0:55:36.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.77,0:55:39.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.27,0:55:41.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.92,0:55:44.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.22,0:55:46.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:49.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.97,0:56:13.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,出現緊急事態！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.20,0:56:17.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Humarise 的網路直播已經開始放送了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.70,0:56:18.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,把直播調出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.07,0:56:21.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們 Humarise 組織
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.67,0:56:22.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,即將展開行動
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.30,0:56:26.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為了從染上“個性”這一惡疾的人類手中
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.05,0:56:30.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,保護無個性的純粹人類
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.27,0:56:35.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們開發的拯救人類裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.15,0:56:38.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已經安裝在全球25個國家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:41.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,而且我們的人已經有所行動
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.25,0:56:42.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不是吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.90,0:56:45.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,人類救贖的時刻
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.90,0:56:47.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將在兩小時後到來
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.57,0:56:49.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,兩個小時！？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.85,0:56:50.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,然而
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.65,0:56:52.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們也非冷血無情
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.17,0:56:56.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果想阻止計劃的進行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.85,0:56:59.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們可以告訴你們
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.17,0:57:01.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,安裝了拯救人類裝置的國家有哪些
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.72,0:57:03.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.22,0:57:06.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,抱有和我們相反思想的你們
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.62,0:57:09.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也有和我們平等權利的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.40,0:57:12.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,長官
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.50,0:57:14.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已被安裝 Trigger 炸彈 的25個國家
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.25,0:57:18.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,和 Humarise 分支機構的所在地一致！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.02,0:57:20.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可能這又是一個陷阱…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.77,0:57:23.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就算真的是陷阱……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.60,0:57:28.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,向待命英雄隊伍 下達行動命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.80,0:57:29.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.17,0:57:32.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,設有 Trigger 炸彈的所有城市
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.37,0:57:33.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,發生市民恐慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.50,0:57:39.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,恐慌已經蔓延到
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.50,0:57:40.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,目標城市之外的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.15,0:57:46.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,交通系統逐漸陷入癱瘓！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.50,0:57:48.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.72,0:57:50.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,食日者 你負責救出傷者
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.10,0:57:52.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,烈怒賴雄斗 和 Real Steel
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.65,0:57:54.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,確保撤離路線
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.55,0:57:55.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--了解！--了解！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.55,0:57:58.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,奇美拉庫拉肯！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.52,0:58:04.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.70,0:58:06.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,烈怒頑斗裂屠！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.20,0:58:10.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,請趕緊去避難！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.55,0:58:12.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,請快點行動！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.00,0:58:12.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,水泥俠
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.17,0:58:14.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要上了 Mic！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.65,0:58:18.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,往這看 大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.15,0:58:20.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們已經為各位設置了出路
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.50,0:58:22.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,請離開上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.92,0:58:23.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.02,0:58:25.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--得救了！謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.02,0:58:25.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.45,0:58:28.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,靠你們了 搜索班
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.92,0:58:32.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,務必要會找出 Trigger 炸彈
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:33.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,聽到沒！？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.07,0:58:34.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,了解！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.42,0:58:40.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哇吹！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.02,0:58:43.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡的疏散工作就交給我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.47,0:58:46.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們去搜索 Trigger 炸彈
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.60,0:58:47.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--收到！--收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.77,0:58:48.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,月詠
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.87,0:58:50.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,引導市民避險任務交給美國隊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.20,0:58:53.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們從空中尋找 Trigger 炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.20,0:58:54.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,了解！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.80,0:58:57.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,去吧 剛翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.67,0:59:01.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,仔細檢查每一個角落！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.17,0:59:03.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,取蔭同學
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.07,0:59:06.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拿著這些探測儀去尋找 Trigger 炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.25,0:59:06.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.20,0:59:09.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一定會找到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.37,0:59:10.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,百醬
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.67,0:59:12.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們去下一個地點吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.20,0:59:13.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.97,0:59:18.36,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這麼寬廣的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.50,0:59:20.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真的能找到炸彈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:22.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,各位！各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.10,0:59:23.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--各位！--你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.37,0:59:24.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--薩拉姆！？--薩拉姆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.45,0:59:27.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,寧可被發現 不如去發現！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.75,0:59:29.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,跟上我的腳步！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.50,0:59:30.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他真快！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.27,0:59:32.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他不是白紙薄薄的！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.82,0:59:35.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,克蕾爾 有發現 Trigger 炸彈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.62,0:59:37.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這個區域沒有發現
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.32,0:59:38.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,正移動到下一個區域！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.55,0:59:45.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快點回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.27,0:59:52.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哇 驚人的資料夾數量…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.50,0:59:54.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們應該先看哪個……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.82,0:59:55.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,閃開！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.55,0:59:57.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,最新創建日期的檔案…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.12,0:59:59.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就是這個影片
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.77,1:00:03.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.97,1:00:04.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,叫做艾倫基爾
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.10,1:00:07.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是被 Humarise 綁架的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.00,1:00:09.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一名科學家
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.92,1:00:10.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綁架
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.42,1:00:12.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Humarise
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.72,1:00:15.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將許多科學家的家人當作人質
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.97,1:00:18.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,迫使科學家們開發“個性”因子誘發炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.00,1:00:22.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,第一次投入炸彈的恐怖襲擊

Dialogue: 1,1:00:22.75,1:00:27.62,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,是為了吸引優秀的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.75,1:00:27.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,聚集到 Humarise 各分支的所在地的布局


Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.25,1:00:30.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,再然後
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.75,1:00:32.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,啟動各地的“個性”因子誘發炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.42,1:00:34.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將英雄們
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.82,1:00:36.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一舉殲滅
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.97,1:00:40.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,失去了頂級英雄之後的社會
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.22,1:00:41.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就會分崩瓦解
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.50,1:00:43.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在這混亂之中
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.95,1:00:46.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,消滅其他“個性”持有者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.40,1:00:49.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,創造一個只有無“個性”者的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.87,1:00:52.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那才是 Humarise …
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.97,1:00:54.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,弗雷克特·丹恩…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.57,1:00:55.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真正的目標
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.22,1:00:59.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我希望我的聲音能傳達給英雄們
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.80,1:01:01.44,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還有就是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.15,1:01:04.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,和我一同被綁架的同事埃迪·索爾
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.80,1:01:07.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他用性命換取而來的這把炸彈拆除鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.55,1:01:09.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,請用它
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.55,1:01:11.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,來拯救世界！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.07,1:01:22.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,重複一下報導
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.12,1:01:26.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,倡導拯救人類的團體—— Humarise
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.20,1:01:28.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在世界各地設置了炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.35,1:01:31.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們已經發表聲明 在兩個小時內
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.55,1:01:33.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,準確來說還有1小時52分鐘 炸彈就會爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.85,1:01:37.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在放置了 Humarise 炸彈的地區
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.22,1:01:38.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已造成市民恐慌
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.08,1:01:40.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄們一直在積極引導市民避難
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.70,1:01:43.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,並在進行拆彈作業
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.04,1:01:46.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在炸彈影響範圍內的危險區域如下…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.60,1:01:48.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,開玩笑吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.20,1:01:50.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,奧森的炸彈波及區域
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.90,1:01:52.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我家也包括在內
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.82,1:01:53.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.48,1:01:56.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哥哥呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.48,1:02:02.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們把這個計劃發給日本總部
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.78,1:02:04.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,讓他們命令英雄隊伍撤退--
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.25,1:02:05.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--這樣才不行
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.40,1:02:12.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,其他英雄還在尋找 Trigger 炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.74,1:02:16.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,即使知道自己就是目標
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.82,1:02:18.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,即使知道眼前就是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.26,1:02:21.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但只要還有需要救援的市民
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.32,1:02:24.64,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拋棄人們保全自己這種事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.02,1:02:26.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄絕不可能做出來
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.88,1:02:31.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,計劃考慮得如此長遠！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.80,1:02:36.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要是這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.30,1:02:37.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那我們用鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.60,1:02:39.41,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無論如何也要拆除炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.17,1:02:42.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是在哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.87,1:02:43.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.94,1:02:46.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不用說 答案肯定就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.42,1:02:49.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,鑰匙都有了 哪有笨蛋不告訴人去哪拆除炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.67,1:02:53.04,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有發表犯罪聲明的地點在…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.31,1:02:55.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡就是那些混蛋的基地總部！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.08,1:02:57.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,小勝
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.73,1:02:59.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Trigger 炸彈的控制室在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.60,1:03:00.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,正在找啊 臭笨谷！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.17,1:03:04.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在基地最底下…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.25,1:03:06.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,地點是知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.65,1:03:09.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不過這裡離那有400多公里遠
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.85,1:03:11.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,能趕過去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.80,1:03:14.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我有個主意
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.85,1:03:21.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別慌張
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.85,1:03:23.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我知道基礎的操作
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.17,1:03:25.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現在不是畏畏縮縮的時候！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.02,1:03:32.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一定要制止 Trigger 炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.91,1:03:38.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,失心瘋的混蛋一律轟碎！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.75,1:03:44.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對要保護……
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.95,1:03:46.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.94,1:03:48.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…還有世界！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.22,1:03:52.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,收到來自派遣至奧森的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.90,1:03:54.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,焦凍發過來的消息
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.80,1:03:58.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他說得到了 Trigger 炸彈的拆除鑰匙！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.80,1:03:59.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他的所在地呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.02,1:04:01.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他正趕往 Trigger 炸彈主控制室——
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.90,1:04:04.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Humarise 的隱藏基地
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.02,1:04:07.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,轟少年……爆豪少年……
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.94,1:04:10.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷少年…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.40,1:04:14.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,焦凍正在前往拆除 Trigger 炸彈的路上！？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.20,1:04:15.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,立刻去援助他們——
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.42,1:04:15.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.22,1:04:18.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拆除炸彈是我們的最優先事項
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.74,1:04:19.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,安德瓦！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.65,1:04:20.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.55,1:04:22.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,發現了 Trigger 炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.17,1:04:22.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,地點呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.40,1:04:25.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,奧森塔的北門門口前方
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.02,1:04:27.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在一輛大型貨車內！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.85,1:04:29.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在奧森塔附近的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.30,1:04:31.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,執行回收任務！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.74,1:04:32.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--了解！--了解！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.77,1:04:34.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,克蕾爾！？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.02,1:04:37.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.45,1:04:41.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,障子！總部說綠谷他們正前往去拆除炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.85,1:04:43.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別分心 耳郎！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.74,1:04:45.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們現在該做的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.17,1:04:47.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是好好完成自己的任務
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.45,1:04:48.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,呃…嗯！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.71,1:04:52.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,發現 Trigger 炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.60,1:04:56.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在那列火車上…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.60,1:04:58.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…第三個集裝箱裡！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.48,1:04:59.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.68,1:05:08.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是敵人聯軍！？為什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.31,1:05:10.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,切 有守衛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.54,1:05:12.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無重麗！Froppy！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.45,1:05:14.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將 Trigger 炸彈帶到安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.94,1:05:16.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,--是的！-- 是的！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.02,1:05:20.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我相信笨久君他們能夠拆除炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.54,1:05:21.38,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是現在
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.64,1:05:23.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們也要做力所能及的事情…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.87,1:05:27.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,走開！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.54,1:05:31.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,各小隊都找出 Trigger 炸彈了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.92,1:05:33.04,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但他們遇到了 Humarise 的阻攔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.04,1:05:34.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無法將其移除
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.80,1:05:36.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,離爆炸還剩不到30分鐘…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.34,1:05:40.91,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,每位英雄都在拼盡全力戰鬥……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.52,1:05:42.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.92,1:05:44.88,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,未來的英雄們！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.91,1:05:52.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快到了！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.40,1:06:00.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,去治療到來的重症患者
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.40,1:06:05.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那就是他們的總部！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.82,1:06:08.38,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要著陸了 抓緊點！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.65,1:06:10.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪直接掉頭回去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.02,1:06:12.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.14,1:06:14.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,平民好好待著就行……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.17,1:06:15.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,從這裡開始…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.17,1:06:17.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…是英雄的工作！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.60,1:06:26.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,雜碎給我閃開！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.70,1:06:33.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們也有成員是“個性”持有者！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.45,1:06:36.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不只有僱傭兵嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.34,1:06:48.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,小勝！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.75,1:06:50.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.47,1:07:00.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.42,1:07:04.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆豪 這裡就交給你！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.45,1:07:05.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不許進去！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.45,1:07:08.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要對我指手畫腳！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.11,1:07:10.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,站住！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.14,1:07:13.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,下一個路口右轉！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.85,1:07:14.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.40,1:07:24.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一群雜碎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.25,1:07:37.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼你們這些敵人聯軍混蛋在幫助 Humarise
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.97,1:07:41.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們被 Humarise 選中了！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.91,1:07:43.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,只要和他們聯手
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.11,1:07:45.81,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們就可以在新世界有一席之位！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.22,1:07:50.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,只顧著保全自己嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.31,1:07:53.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也太自私了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.50,1:07:55.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你們這些混蛋敵人聯軍…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.31,1:07:57.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,去死！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.37,1:08:22.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那些傢伙竟然自作主張…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.57,1:08:29.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你就是洛迪·索爾 對吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.22,1:08:45.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,轟君！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.22,1:08:46.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你先過去！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.28,1:08:47.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒時間了！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.85,1:08:57.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一招解決你們！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.42,1:09:00.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,膨冷熱波！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.42,1:10:16.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他是扭曲自己身邊的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:19.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,來控制水的流動！？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.07,1:10:23.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆碎風！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.94,1:10:42.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.71,1:10:44.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連爆炸本身都被切斷了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.90,1:10:49.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,少裝出一副
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.20,1:10:52.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,從容的樣子！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.27,1:11:00.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,零距離攻擊！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.42,1:11:07.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,好弱！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.08,1:11:10.71,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,飛來飛去 煩死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.74,1:11:36.41,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那個笑聲…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.80,1:11:39.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,煩死人了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.71,1:12:00.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,像你這樣的雜碎不可能知道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.31,1:12:04.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我在戰鬥時安置了手榴彈
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.67,1:12:30.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,終於變成了名副其實的瘋子！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.68,1:12:33.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,再快點 再快點
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.08,1:12:35.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,給我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.97,1:12:36.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.35,1:13:02.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,離開這
Dialogue: 1,1:13:02.74,1:13:06.51,Subtitles2,,0,0,0,,這不是像你這樣的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.74,1:13:06.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“個性”重症患者可以進來的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.91,1:13:14.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡是給人類帶來救贖的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.32,1:13:16.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,神聖之地
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.77,1:13:20.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.97,1:13:22.21,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“個性”末日論
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.21,1:13:24.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,根本沒有經過科學實驗證實！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.51,1:13:26.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這不過是一個傳聞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.05,1:13:29.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這種荒唐的理論都能當真
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.52,1:13:31.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還做出這麼可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.45,1:13:35.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,純粹的人類
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.15,1:13:36.61,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,現在正受到
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.75,1:13:38.91,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,名為“個性”的疾病的威脅
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.88,1:13:42.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,隨著時間的流逝開始混合 進化
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.15,1:13:46.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將失控的人類推向毀滅之淵
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.11,1:13:48.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,才沒有這回事！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.11,1:13:51.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不管有沒有“個性”和有沒有生病都沒關係！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.40,1:13:54.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們都是生而平等的人類！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.97,1:13:58.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你們已經病入膏肓
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.74,1:14:02.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,果然只有我才能完成使命
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.85,1:14:05.88,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對會阻止“Trigger炸彈爆炸”！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.35,1:14:09.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆碎風！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.65,1:14:44.71,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.11,1:14:48.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我一生下來就身患疾病
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.34,1:14:51.03,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一種絕不會消失的疾病
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.84,1:14:54.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將一切東西都反射回去的疾病
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.12,1:15:06.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,明明你自己都有“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.91,1:15:09.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼不願意相信“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.05,1:15:20.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連遠程攻擊也……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.02,1:15:22.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你說相信“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.85,1:15:27.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,愚昧的人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.22,1:15:30.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都是這個病的錯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.35,1:15:34.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我從來沒有被父母抱過
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.00,1:15:37.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連我幼時就認識的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.70,1:15:39.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還有我心愛的人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.97,1:15:42.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連感情都被反射出去…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.48,1:15:43.78,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所有一切一一離開了我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.68,1:15:47.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將一切反射的我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.04,1:15:50.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,甚至做不到自我了結
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.28,1:15:55.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,無法控制的“個性”只會徒生痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.28,1:15:59.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,然後人的肉體和心靈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.17,1:16:02.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都被不斷進化的“個性”壓抑！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.71,1:16:40.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我否定我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.22,1:16:45.78,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,名為“個性”的惡疾
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.25,1:16:48.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我會從這個世界上根除
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.11,1:16:51.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,將純粹無“個性”的人類
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.81,1:16:54.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,從滅絕中拯救出來！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.22,1:17:08.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真可悲…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.11,1:17:16.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還有五分鐘…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.45,1:17:19.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.98,1:17:22.55,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,終於要邁開第一步了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.45,1:17:26.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,從滅絕頂級英雄開始
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.97,1:17:28.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不讓你得逞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.82,1:17:31.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,Trigger 炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.92,1:17:33.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我絕對會
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.30,1:17:34.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,阻止！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.54,1:17:36.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.30,1:17:39.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連同你的同伴都一起死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.50,1:18:46.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛…洛迪……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.00,1:18:48.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,為什麼……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.06,1:18:50.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已經沒事了 笨久
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.20,1:18:53.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,很危險……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.05,1:18:54.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快從這裡……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.25,1:18:56.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,離開……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.46,1:18:57.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我會的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.52,1:18:59.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等我把這個給那傢伙之後
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.60,1:19:04.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,拆除炸彈的鑰匙……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.71,1:19:05.88,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪……！？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.27,1:19:08.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們說了…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.40,1:19:13.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…只要將鑰匙給他們
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.60,1:19:14.71,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們就會中止奧森的爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.77,1:19:18.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪 不能這樣做…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.91,1:19:22.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們一定會阻止炸彈爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.35,1:19:26.35,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你那樣的身體是要如何阻止他們
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.31,1:19:28.24,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有時間了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.62,1:19:30.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,炸彈要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.62,1:19:31.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,遊戲結束了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.51,1:19:33.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.62,1:19:35.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.62,1:19:37.27,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,起碼弟弟和妹妹
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.72,1:19:38.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我要保護他們
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.61,1:19:45.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.81,1:19:47.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我只是個沒出息的混混
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.25,1:19:49.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不像你是的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.95,1:19:51.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒辦法保護一切
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.50,1:19:53.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,承擔一切……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.45,1:19:55.61,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,世界還是我的家人…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.31,1:19:57.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果只能選擇其中一個
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.71,1:20:00.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,那我必須選擇
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.05,1:20:03.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我的父親
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.55,1:20:04.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不也是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.22,1:20:07.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.05,1:20:11.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你的父親 埃迪·索爾
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.62,1:20:15.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,協助我們研發了拯救人類的炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.42,1:20:20.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,原來埃迪博士…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.54,1:20:23.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,埃迪·索爾用性命換取而來的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.20,1:20:25.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這把炸彈拆除鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.34,1:20:27.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,請用它
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.54,1:20:28.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,來拯救世界！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.51,1:20:36.15,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,什麼“協助我們”
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.42,1:20:38.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,明明挾持了我的家人做人質
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.62,1:20:40.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,逼迫他聽命你而已
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.91,1:20:43.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,多虧如此 他做出了正確的選擇
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.80,1:20:47.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,然後你和你父親一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.94,1:20:51.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,做出了正確的選擇來保護你所愛的人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.62,1:20:53.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.77,1:20:56.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,正因為深愛著人類
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.87,1:20:58.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以選擇了這個計劃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.34,1:21:01.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪……不要……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.22,1:21:04.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪……！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.62,1:21:08.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.34,1:21:14.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是時候放棄了 英雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.94,1:21:16.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所謂人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.14,1:21:19.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都會被別人所背叛
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.20,1:21:21.12,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也不例外
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.30,1:21:23.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,常有的事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.37,1:21:25.75,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒什麼好哭的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.88,1:21:27.78,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.80,1:21:37.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,吶 洛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.30,1:21:39.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你也有“個性”吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.03,1:21:41.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是怎麼樣的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.62,1:21:43.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你不會笑我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.30,1:21:45.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不會笑！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.88,1:21:47.78,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.65,1:21:50.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對不會笑！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.37,1:21:54.91,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我的“個性”是…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.92,1:22:05.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,皮諾！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.60,1:22:12.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,太好了！一切按計劃進行！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.87,1:22:16.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,出久！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.77,1:22:18.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,愚蠢的傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.10,1:22:24.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.17,1:22:38.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.45,1:22:45.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.02,1:22:51.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,耍小聰明…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.77,1:22:58.71,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.80,1:23:04.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,揍飛那個混蛋東西！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.68,1:23:07.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我會阻止炸彈！上吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.94,1:23:10.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,上吧 英雄！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.77,1:23:12.52,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,快上！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.02,1:23:22.96,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不會讓你通過…！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.62,1:23:24.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…我後面的大門
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.12,1:23:26.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,絕對不讓！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.67,1:23:41.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.87,1:23:43.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你也有“個性”吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.87,1:23:44.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是怎麼樣的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.82,1:23:50.44,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,牠就是我的“個性”…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.87,1:23:53.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,皮諾的一舉一動…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.49,1:23:55.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…投射我內心的真實想法
Comment: 0,1:23:55.72,1:23:57.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.05,1:23:58.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不管我撒了多少謊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.05,1:24:00.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,只要有皮諾在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.35,1:24:01.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就會暴露我的真實想法
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.42,1:24:03.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真的是
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.48,1:24:05.81,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒什麼用的“個性”對吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.22,1:24:11.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有這回事 洛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.45,1:24:15.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒法說謊…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.68,1:24:17.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…真是一個美妙的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:42.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可惡！右側的攻擊來不及做出反應…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.55,1:25:15.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,終於…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.37,1:25:17.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…安靜下來了！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.07,1:25:37.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這次真的要…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.95,1:25:42.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…轟碎你們！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.10,1:25:45.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,榴彈炮…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.45,1:25:48.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…著弾！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.95,1:26:11.88,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一群…雜碎…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.91,1:26:58.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不會讓你妨礙綠谷！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.74,1:27:00.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,膨冷熱波！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.44,1:27:20.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,連火焰都能操縱嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.10,1:27:21.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.70,1:27:24.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,使出我目前能使出的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.40,1:27:25.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,最強招式
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.10,1:27:31.10,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,赫灼熱拳…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.94,1:27:34.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…噴射焚燒！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.45,1:28:28.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也想…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.97,1:28:31.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…像老爸那樣
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.17,1:28:36.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我也想做個…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.90,1:28:41.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…像笨久一樣的…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.48,1:28:51.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪！？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.22,1:29:01.71,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,父子倆都白白送死……
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.31,1:29:04.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,廢物沒有活著的意義
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.14,1:29:06.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你錯了！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.05,1:29:10.18,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.28,1:29:14.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…我的朋友不是什麼廢物！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.65,1:29:18.91,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有用的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.94,1:29:21.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你還不明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.77,1:29:24.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,理所當然的…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.40,1:29:27.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我相信洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.57,1:29:31.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我相信英雄！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.62,1:29:39.72,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,掩護安德瓦！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.11,1:29:41.23,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,焦凍
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.60,1:29:44.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡交給我就夠了！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.37,1:29:47.87,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,去吧 剛翼！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.07,1:29:50.07,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,送到波及範圍之外的地方！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.74,1:29:54.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,霍克斯 又發現了新的“Trigger炸彈”！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.60,1:29:56.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你說什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.02,1:29:58.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這裡妥善處理完畢！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.60,1:30:00.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,剩下的 Trigger 炸彈呢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.17,1:30:01.67,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,還有兩個沒找出來！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.67,1:30:02.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.62,1:30:03.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,又發現了一個炸彈！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.70,1:30:04.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,一共有三個！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.97,1:30:07.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們絕對不會放棄！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.00,1:30:09.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,對吧 爆豪！？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.42,1:30:15.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,就這樣送到天上去——
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.62,1:30:17.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,哇吹！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.65,1:30:19.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,御茶子醬！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.65,1:30:20.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,, Trigger 炸彈——
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.82,1:30:44.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.42,1:30:46.32,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄不懂放棄兩字！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.11,1:30:49.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們怎麼可能放棄！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.80,1:31:10.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,威力果然提升了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.40,1:31:15.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不對…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.65,1:31:18.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不是那回事…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.77,1:31:47.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.34,1:31:50.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,“個性”已經達到極限了……！？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.25,1:31:52.57,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,這種事有可能嗎……
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.14,1:31:55.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你已經放棄了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.62,1:31:59.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果你沒有放棄
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.20,1:32:02.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不管多艱難都嘗試打破“個性”的桎梏
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.00,1:32:05.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也許你就可以觸摸到他人……
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.22,1:32:08.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但你把它當作是病
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.32,1:32:10.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,自暴自棄
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.97,1:32:12.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,擅自絕望
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.05,1:32:15.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,你已經放棄打破自己的桎梏了！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.10,1:32:17.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,住口…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.68,1:32:18.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.68,1:32:22.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,知道“永不放棄”的涵義
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.27,1:32:24.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,住口…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.37,1:32:28.82,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們總是提醒自己
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.08,1:32:31.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,住口…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.70,1:32:34.95,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,衝向更遙遠的彼方
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.38,1:32:36.46,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,PLUS！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.46,1:32:37.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,ULTRA!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.22,1:32:41.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,給我住口！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.27,1:33:23.34,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,底特律 爆碎—風！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.85,1:33:52.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所謂英雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.03,1:33:56.37,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…乃是打破絕境之人！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.94,1:34:00.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,歐爾麥特
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.30,1:34:03.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,綠谷少年！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.97,1:34:05.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.22,1:34:08.25,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,要保護的事物有很多
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.30,1:34:10.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.11,1:34:13.54,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.57,1:34:16.48,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我們不會
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.48,1:34:18.03,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,認輸！！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.55,1:35:02.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,世界…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.30,1:35:05.18,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…合眾…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.05,1:35:07.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…國…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.28,1:35:11.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,爆碎—風！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.95,1:35:38.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已經…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.35,1:35:40.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,…太晚了…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.50,1:35:56.41,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,時間限制
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.70,1:35:57.81,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已經過了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.57,1:36:00.28,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.05,1:36:03.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,倒數計時停了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.37,1:36:05.92,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.47,1:36:07.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,解除了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.04,1:36:09.70,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.24,1:36:12.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,他們做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.88,1:36:20.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,幹得好 大家
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.54,1:36:45.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,謝謝 洛迪…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.20,1:36:47.44,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,再堅持一下
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.90,1:36:48.94,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,馬上送你去醫院
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.94,1:36:49.90,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,笨久…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.80,1:36:52.44,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.20,1:36:54.64,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,有像老爸一樣…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.00,1:36:57.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,保護了家人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.80,1:37:00.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.00,1:37:01.74,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,炸彈
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.60,1:37:04.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,僺止了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.68,1:37:05.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.77,1:37:09.01,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我有像笨久一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.00,1:37:11.11,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,扛起責任了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.88,1:37:14.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是的 你做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.54,1:37:16.71,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,太厲害了 洛迪！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.80,1:37:22.62,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.60,1:37:25.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真帥氣！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.87,1:37:58.47,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,震驚世界的恐怖襲擊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.62,1:38:00.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,通過英雄團隊的努力
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.52,1:38:02.31,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已被成功阻止
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.12,1:38:05.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,以領導為首實施恐怖行動的若干名幹部
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.40,1:38:07.02,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,也陸續被捕
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.02,1:38:09.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,此案件已經進入收尾工作環節
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.62,1:38:15.14,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,此次事件結束了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.74,1:38:19.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,沒有一個 Trigger 炸彈 爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.51,1:38:22.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,英雄們最終保護了世界
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.22,1:38:25.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,但是 不僅僅是英雄們
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.68,1:38:29.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,真正拯救了世界的人是…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.08,1:38:31.65,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,同樣沒有放棄的人是…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.71,1:38:50.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,洛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.28,1:38:53.85,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不是後天才出院嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.22,1:38:55.77,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,已經好得差不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.17,1:38:57.88,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.25,1:38:59.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,如果之前就那樣死了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.80,1:39:02.30,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,說不定就成了一代傳奇呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.30,1:39:04.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要說這麼倒霉的話
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.34,1:39:10.91,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,吶 洛迪接下來要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.40,1:39:13.51,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,做回往常做的事而已
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.62,1:39:15.40,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.40,1:39:16.50,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不管是平凡還是刺激的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.50,1:39:20.00,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,都要去體驗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.54,1:39:22.20,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.91,1:39:28.45,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,航班NY224即將開始登機
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.37,1:39:30.68,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,是時候說再見了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.85,1:39:33.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,不要再來奧森了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.37,1:39:35.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,和笨久在一起 一定沒有什麼好事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.77,1:39:38.08,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,在日本當英雄當個夠吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.77,1:39:44.60,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,我會再來找你玩
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.51,1:39:52.17,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,別再來了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.37,1:40:18.05,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,大叔 有工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.28,1:40:21.42,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,可以的話 介紹一個正經點的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.14,1:40:26.22,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,有一名員工辭職了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.65,1:40:27.80,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.17,1:40:32.97,Subtitles,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:50.07,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:52.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.47,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:04:00.65,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,Humarise發表了對前幾天的\N無差別恐怖攻擊的犯罪聲明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.40,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,這是由弗雷克特·丹恩領導創立的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:07.30,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,一個倡導拯救人類的意識形態組織
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.97,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,恐怖攻擊中投入使用的裝置

Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:15.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我們推測含有\N觸發產生個性因子的物質“Ideo Trigger”

Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,往後稱這個裝置為“Trigger炸彈”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:22.85,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我們精英英雄團隊的使命

Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:27.05,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,是一次性搜索出坐落在全球各地的\N共25個Humarise分支機構


Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:29.30,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,在逮捕他們的人員的同時
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:34.45,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,迅速回收在機構裡的“Trigger炸彈”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:38.45,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,預測設施裡的成員不會乖乖就範
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:41.42,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,還極有可能使用“Trigger炸彈”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:45.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,所以我們必須避免向當地執法部門尋求幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:49.05,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,希望你們能迅速、謹慎完成這項任務
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:19.80,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,各組英雄小隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,開始任務！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.10,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,最後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:05.70,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我們搜索了Humarise在世界各地的所有分支機構
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.30,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,都沒能發現一個“Trigger炸彈”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:18.80,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,不行 得趕緊回去現場拿回手提箱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:20.32,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,不過還能找回來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.47,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,萬一有人撿到了 看到裡面的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:24.52,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,肯定會據為己有！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:26.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,這堆寶石還是敵人聯軍的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.55,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,他們不可能輕易了事！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.60,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦？怎麼辦才好！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,警察
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.15,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.47,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,準備也太齊全了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.85,0:22:59.77,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,得趕緊離開這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:47.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我們突然被警察襲擊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:23:59.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,--先冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:01.40,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,一件一件告訴我 發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.45,0:24:10.12,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,但發現手提箱裡沒有任何寶石——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.62,0:24:39.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒做！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.05,0:24:49.85,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,關於這個 我們會去調查
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:51.65,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,你馬上離開那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.77,0:24:53.37,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,警察會用 GPS 跟蹤你的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.55,0:24:56.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,關掉手機後 記得取出電池
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.07,0:28:22.65,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,不管是什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.00,0:28:24.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,都不能和警察正面衝突
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.87,0:28:28.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,現在奧森的警察正在追捕我們
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:29.75,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,如果我們能跨過邊境
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:31.75,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,進到鄰國克萊德
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.17,0:28:34.22,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,那他們應該奈何不了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.25,0:29:26.70,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,德拉瓦爆碎風--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.20,0:29:28.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,--空中武力！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.07,0:30:09.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,日本排名第一的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.50,0:30:10.60,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,安德瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.40,0:32:23.65,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,你好 我是斯坦利克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.90,0:32:26.60,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,唔？是洛迪嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.97,0:32:37.07,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,--你個蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.60,0:32:46.75,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我不想聽到任何藉口
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.50,0:32:49.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,如果你不想找死 那就給我送快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.55,0:32:50.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,聽到了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.80,0:37:12.62,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,如果這個手提箱和某個犯罪案件有關
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.85,0:37:15.75,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,決不能輕易把它交給別人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.67,0:43:51.15,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.62,0:43:54.02,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,正要抓到他們的時候讓他們逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.72,0:43:58.48,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,現在已經安排所有組織人員去追捕他們
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.51,0:44:04.62,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,恐怕我的權限沒有這麼大…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.57,0:44:07.14,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.55,0:44:08.87,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為了人類的救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.22,0:59:42.05,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,焦凍
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.22,0:59:43.37,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,你在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.91,1:06:42.71,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,是音波！？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.54,1:08:02.54,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,好快！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.97,1:09:33.60,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,火焰無效！？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.71,1:09:42.82,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,沒有自我意識
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.85,1:09:44.57,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,Trigger導致的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.22,1:12:50.28,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,這就是最深處的房間……
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.05,1:12:53.40,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,也就是說
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.25,1:12:55.35,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,Trigger 炸彈終端系統
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.35,1:12:57.65,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,就在這扇門的背後
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.28,1:13:08.58,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,Humarise的組織領袖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.28,1:13:10.48,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,弗雷克特·丹恩
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.57,1:14:33.81,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,被……被反彈回來了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.11,1:14:35.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.21,1:14:38.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,這衝擊力和威力……
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.82,1:14:41.74,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,簡直就像承受了爆碎風一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.45,1:14:56.25,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,果然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.54,1:14:59.74,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,將身體收到的攻擊反射回去的“個性”
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.25,1:15:02.74,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,而且“個性”還一直是啟動狀態
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.54,1:16:04.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,在碰撞的一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.24,1:16:07.02,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,消除掉“個性”！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.84,1:16:12.50,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,就是是這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.65,1:16:14.22,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,還是反射回來了……！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.45,1:16:31.68,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,他將所有的衝擊力都集中到一點上……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.52,1:16:34.34,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,既然這樣…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.10,1:16:36.30,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,那就速度全開
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.30,1:16:37.30,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,衝向控制室！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.31,1:17:45.22,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,麗日同學…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.31,1:17:47.40,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,哇吹同學…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.97,1:17:51.05,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,上鳴君…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.77,1:17:52.60,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,瀨呂君…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.15,1:17:53.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,峰田君…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.00,1:17:57.82,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,切島君…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.70,1:17:59.60,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,障子君…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.48,1:18:01.28,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,耳郎同學…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.70,1:18:04.88,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,八百萬同學…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.45,1:18:08.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.68,1:18:10.40,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,都在拚盡全力戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.14,1:18:14.40,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為了制止 Trigger 炸彈…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.28,1:18:19.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,為了守護大家的笑容…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.11,1:18:24.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,快思考…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.15,1:18:27.75,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,能夠打敗他的辦法！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.40,1:26:23.48,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,意…意識要…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.92,1:26:26.35,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.65,1:26:34.08,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,給我趕上！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.02,1:27:57.07,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,綠谷…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.57,1:27:59.68,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,一定要…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.25,1:28:01.68,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,…阻止他們
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.10,1:30:23.05,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,我不會放棄的！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.02,1:30:26.25,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,笨久君永遠不會——
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.51,1:30:32.77,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,綠谷他們永遠不會放棄！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.85,1:30:35.05,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,所以我們也不會放棄！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.80,1:30:42.20,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,絕對不會放棄！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.25,1:31:20.82,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,威力在減弱！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.02,1:31:22.00,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.45,1:31:25.57,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,他的反射“個性”是有限度的！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.22,1:31:27.90,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.82,1:31:33.22,Subtitles - Italics,,0,0,0,,那我就超越極限！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.52,0:46:44.82,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,我們 一如往常
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.35,0:46:52.50,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,懷揣各自的悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.80,0:46:58.87,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,期待著
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.32,0:47:06.37,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,明天來臨
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.49,0:47:19.92,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,SP,我們 不算完美
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.32,0:47:27.32,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,同形形色色的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.75,0:47:37.75,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,這個他那個她
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.42,0:47:41.30,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,擁有著當下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.02,0:47:52.27,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,飛快流逝的景象裡
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.40,0:47:57.40,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,一切都融化褪色
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.07,0:48:05.12,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,街角賣花的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.72,0:48:12.40,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,讓人想起那時的你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.70,0:48:20.80,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,啊 鐘聲響起
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.87,0:48:29.12,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,不要停下啊 才剛剛開始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.12,0:48:35.05,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,就算忘得一乾二淨
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.05,0:48:45.42,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,在某個地方 你一定還是那樣笑著
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.65,0:48:52.35,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,在笑著 ~
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.14,1:39:57.57,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,空空如也的城鎮 這般寂靜
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.42,1:40:03.11,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,這雙手 還遠不夠可靠
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.97,1:40:09.00,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,可這副身軀還在
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.00,1:40:15.40,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,這雙眼裡 也還殘留著些許夢想
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.08,1:40:40.82,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,無聲的房間令人難耐
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.26,1:40:46.22,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,沒有你的日子味同嚼蠟
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.80,1:40:49.42,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,可仍然
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.68,1:40:51.94,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,靠這副身軀堅強站起
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.09,1:40:57.54,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,眼前的現實等待著我
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.68,1:41:02.85,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,雖有時會被暴雨擊打
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.93,1:41:08.36,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,會不禁在夜裡獨自嘆息
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.36,1:41:11.37,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,可所有的憐憫與悲傷
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.39,1:41:14.18,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,都會匯聚起來 化作“將心比心”
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.25,1:41:18.73,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,那大約就是我們靈魂的歸所
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.94,1:41:19.61,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.76,1:41:21.98,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,已經到了覺醒的時候
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.14,1:41:24.81,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,一腳踢開門扉
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.81,1:41:29.52,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,向著朝霞一路飛奔而去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.84,1:41:35.07,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,此刻 你的呼吸留下痕跡
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.55,1:41:40.96,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,便發覺拂曉時的街道充滿雨露
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.12,1:41:45.93,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,磕磕絆絆跑過每一日
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.93,1:41:50.85,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,越過一段又一段柏油路
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.26,1:41:56.52,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,盡頭一定能看見自由了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.64,1:42:01.95,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,對面的世界正在吶喊呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.95,1:42:03.72,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,一直都在吶喊著
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.18,1:42:29.06,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,無論是以出生地為原型的風景
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.20,1:42:34.05,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,還是虹膜與皮膚本有的命運
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.48,1:42:36.27,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,都一併否定
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.27,1:42:38.90,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,只認準相互承認 相互理解的未來
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.20,1:42:44.60,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,只相信這樣的未來
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.90,1:42:49.96,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,就算有時狂風呼嘯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.20,1:42:55.33,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,你會獨自流下淚水
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.51,1:42:58.46,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,可所有的憐憫與悲傷
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.50,1:43:06.03,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,都會匯聚起來 化作“將心比心”
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.15,1:43:06.97,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.04,1:43:09.26,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,已經到了覺醒的時候
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.26,1:43:12.04,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,一腳踢開門扉
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.16,1:43:16.77,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,向著朝霞一路飛奔而去
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.07,1:43:22.24,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,此刻 你的呼吸留下痕跡
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.79,1:43:28.18,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,便知曉拂曉時的街道充滿雨露
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.18,1:43:33.18,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,磕磕絆絆跑過每一日
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.20,1:43:38.26,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,越過一段又一段柏油路
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.58,1:43:43.78,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,盡頭一定能看見自由了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.90,1:43:49.00,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,對面的世界正在吶喊呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.01,1:43:50.83,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,一直都在吶喊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.15,1:43:56.32,Subtitles - Italics - Lyrics,,0,0,0,,吶喊著你的名字
